{"id":242170,"bangumiId":242170,"type":2,"name":"オーバーロードⅢ","name_cn":"OVERLORD 第三季","date":"2018-07-10","year":"2018","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/47/d4/242170_iz9Ko.jpg"},"summary":"时间为2138年。曾卷起一大风潮的虚拟现实体感型网络游戏《YGGDRASIL》即将迎来停服。玩家飞鼠在曾经以同伴和荣华自傲的根据地纳萨力克地下大坟墓，独自一人安静等待着那一刻。但是，不料发生了“过了结束时间却还没有登出”的异常事态。NPC们开始以自己的意志行动，不止如此，纳萨力克之外展开了从未见过的异世界。飞鼠为了寻找过去的同伴，以公会名安兹·乌尔·恭自称，决定在异世界扬名立万。他与宣誓绝对忠诚的部下一同，向新的地域进军。","rating":{"rank":5971,"total":9873,"count":{"1":81,"2":53,"3":114,"4":346,"5":1095,"6":3459,"7":3294,"8":1072,"9":164,"10":195},"score":6.4},"collection":{"on_hold":215,"dropped":283,"wish":676,"collect":19033,"doing":470},"tags":[{"name":"MADHouse","count":1443,"total_count":112493},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1361,"total_count":509735},{"name":"2018年7月","count":1262,"total_count":26499},{"name":"骨傲天","count":1193,"total_count":5891},{"name":"异世界","count":1153,"total_count":273977},{"name":"穿越","count":1143,"total_count":65871},{"name":"TV","count":957,"total_count":1445254},{"name":"奇幻","count":954,"total_count":492422},{"name":"OVERLORD","count":647,"total_count":3678},{"name":"装逼","count":546,"total_count":9407},{"name":"轻改","count":543,"total_count":155904},{"name":"龙傲天","count":538,"total_count":40831},{"name":"2018","count":476,"total_count":79367},{"name":"网游","count":253,"total_count":14526},{"name":"战斗","count":250,"total_count":489983},{"name":"小说改","count":190,"total_count":167836},{"name":"日本","count":120,"total_count":314419},{"name":"第三季","count":96,"total_count":1586},{"name":"续作","count":58,"total_count":48236},{"name":"伊藤尚往","count":57,"total_count":547},{"name":"搞笑","count":41,"total_count":657793},{"name":"后宫","count":30,"total_co